# Fleet OpenCL default is mesa rusticl: it works on every AMD card
# (APUs and old GPUs included) and does not conflict with the ROCm/HIP
# compute stack, which talks to the GPU directly and stays fully
# available via the desktop/rocm keywords.
# Machines with officially ROCm-supported dGPUs that want AMD's OpenCL
# runtime instead opt in locally with:
#   media-libs/mesa -opencl   (package.use)
#   plus installing dev-libs/rocm-opencl-runtime
media-libs/mesa opencl
